      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the file `poll_transcription.py` that polls a transcription job and returns the transcript, I need to choose a concrete external provider. Given the context, I will use Amazon Transcribe as the external provider because it is a well-known service for speech-to-text transcription. I will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Amazon Transcribe client to poll the transcription job status and retrieve the transcript. </thinking>\n",
